{"seq":4,"slug":"origin-and-security","title":"同源策略与安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/storage-apis/origin-and-security","wordCount":726,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"同源策略与安全\">同源策略与安全</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>同源策略</strong>是浏览器安全的基石，只有协议、域名、端口三者完全一致才算同源。跨源访问由 <strong>CORS</strong> 通过响应头显式授权（非简单请求需预检），<strong>CSP</strong> 限制页面可加载的资源来源，二者共同收敛攻击面。针对常见的 <strong>XSS</strong>，核心是输出转义并避免 <code>innerHTML</code>；针对 <strong>CSRF</strong>，最有效的组合是 SameSite Cookie 加 CSRF Token。</p>\n<h2 id=\"同源策略-same-origin-policy\">同源策略（Same-Origin Policy）</h2><p><strong>同源策略</strong>是浏览器最基本的安全机制。它限制一个源（Origin）的文档或脚本与另一个源的资源交互。两个 URL 的<strong>协议、域名和端口</strong>完全相同才被视为同源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    URL1[&quot;https://app.example.com:443/page&quot;]&#10;    URL1 --&gt; Scheme[&quot;协议: https&quot;]&#10;    URL1 --&gt; Host[&quot;域名: app.example.com&quot;]&#10;    URL1 --&gt; Port[&quot;端口: 443&quot;]&#10;&#10;    Check{&quot;与目标比较&quot;}&#10;    Scheme --&gt; Check&#10;    Host --&gt; Check&#10;    Port --&gt; Check&#10;    Check --&gt;|全部相同| Same[&quot;同源 ✅&quot;]&#10;    Check --&gt;|任一不同| Cross[&quot;跨源 ❌&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    URL1[\"https://app.example.com:443/page\"]\n    URL1 --&gt; Scheme[\"协议: https\"]\n    URL1 --&gt; Host[\"域名: app.example.com\"]\n    URL1 --&gt; Port[\"端口: 443\"]\n\n    Check{\"与目标比较\"}\n    Scheme --&gt; Check\n    Host --&gt; Check\n    Port --&gt; Check\n    Check --&gt;|全部相同| Same[\"同源 ✅\"]\n    Check --&gt;|任一不同| Cross[\"跨源 ❌\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>URL</th>\n<th>与 <code>https://app.example.com</code> 是否同源</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>https://app.example.com/other</code></td>\n<td>✅ 同源</td>\n<td>路径不同不影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>http://app.example.com</code></td>\n<td>❌ 跨源</td>\n<td>协议不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>https://api.example.com</code></td>\n<td>❌ 跨源</td>\n<td>域名不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>https://app.example.com:8080</code></td>\n<td>❌ 跨源</td>\n<td>端口不同</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function isSameOrigin(urlA: string, urlB: string): boolean {&#10;  const a = new URL(urlA);&#10;  const b = new URL(urlB);&#10;  return a.origin === b.origin;&#10;}&#10;&#10;console.log(isSameOrigin(&#39;https://a.com/page1&#39;, &#39;https://a.com/page2&#39;)); // true&#10;console.log(isSameOrigin(&#39;https://a.com&#39;, &#39;http://a.com&#39;)); // false\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isSameOrigin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">urlA</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">urlB</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(urlA);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(urlB);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.origin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.origin;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isSameOrigin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://a.com/page1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://a.com/page2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isSameOrigin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://a.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http://a.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// false</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"cors-跨源资源共享\">CORS（跨源资源共享）</h2><p><strong>CORS（Cross-Origin Resource Sharing）</strong> 允许服务器声明哪些源可以访问其资源，是突破同源策略限制的标准机制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Browser as 浏览器&#10;    participant Server as 服务器&#10;&#10;    Note over Browser,Server: 简单请求&#10;    Browser-&gt;&gt;Server: GET /api/data + Origin: https://app.com&#10;    Server--&gt;&gt;Browser: 200 + Access-Control-Allow-Origin: https://app.com&#10;&#10;    Note over Browser,Server: 预检请求(非简单请求)&#10;    Browser-&gt;&gt;Server: OPTIONS /api/data (预检)&#10;    Server--&gt;&gt;Browser: 204 + CORS headers&#10;    Browser-&gt;&gt;Server: POST /api/data (实际请求)&#10;    Server--&gt;&gt;Browser: 200 + CORS headers\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Browser as 浏览器\n    participant Server as 服务器\n\n    Note over Browser,Server: 简单请求\n    Browser-&gt;&gt;Server: GET /api/data + Origin: https://app.com\n    Server--&gt;&gt;Browser: 200 + Access-Control-Allow-Origin: https://app.com\n\n    Note over Browser,Server: 预检请求(非简单请求)\n    Browser-&gt;&gt;Server: OPTIONS /api/data (预检)\n    Server--&gt;&gt;Browser: 204 + CORS headers\n    Browser-&gt;&gt;Server: POST /api/data (实际请求)\n    Server--&gt;&gt;Browser: 200 + CORS headers</pre><p>简单请求的条件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>方法</td>\n<td>GET / HEAD / POST</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Content-Type</td>\n<td><code>text/plain</code> / <code>multipart/form-data</code> / <code>application/x-www-form-urlencoded</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义请求头</td>\n<td>无（仅允许安全头）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function corsRequest(url: string): Promise&lt;unknown&gt; {&#10;  const response = await fetch(url, {&#10;    mode: &#39;cors&#39;,&#10;    credentials: &#39;include&#39;,&#10;    headers: {&#10;      &#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;application/json&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  const allowOrigin = response.headers.get(&#39;Access-Control-Allow-Origin&#39;);&#10;  const allowCredentials = response.headers.get(&#39;Access-Control-Allow-Credentials&#39;);&#10;&#10;  console.log(&#39;Allow-Origin:&#39;, allowOrigin);&#10;  console.log(&#39;Allow-Credentials:&#39;, allowCredentials);&#10;&#10;  return response.json();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> corsRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mode: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cors'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    credentials: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'include'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    headers: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'Content-Type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'application/json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> allowOrigin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.headers.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Access-Control-Allow-Origin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> allowCredentials</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.headers.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Access-Control-Allow-Credentials'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Allow-Origin:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, allowOrigin);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Allow-Credentials:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, allowCredentials);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CORS 响应头：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>响应头</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Access-Control-Allow-Origin</code></td>\n<td>允许的源（<code>*</code> 或具体源）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Access-Control-Allow-Methods</code></td>\n<td>允许的 HTTP 方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Access-Control-Allow-Headers</code></td>\n<td>允许的请求头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Access-Control-Allow-Credentials</code></td>\n<td>是否允许携带凭证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Access-Control-Max-Age</code></td>\n<td>预检结果缓存时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Access-Control-Expose-Headers</code></td>\n<td>允许 JS 读取的响应头</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *</code> 和 <code>Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true</code> 不能同时使用。需要携带 Cookie 时必须指定具体的源。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"csp-内容安全策略\">CSP（内容安全策略）</h2><p><strong>CSP（Content Security Policy）</strong> 通过 HTTP 响应头或 <code>&lt;meta&gt;</code> 标签限制页面可以加载的资源类型和来源，有效防止 XSS 攻击。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CSPDirectives {&#10;  &#39;default-src&#39;: string[];&#10;  &#39;script-src&#39;: string[];&#10;  &#39;style-src&#39;: string[];&#10;  &#39;img-src&#39;: string[];&#10;  &#39;connect-src&#39;: string[];&#10;  &#39;font-src&#39;: string[];&#10;  &#39;frame-src&#39;: string[];&#10;  &#39;report-uri&#39;?: string[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function buildCSP(directives: Partial&lt;CSPDirectives&gt;): string {&#10;  return Object.entries(directives)&#10;    .map(([key, values]) =&gt; `${key} ${values.join(&#39; &#39;)}`)&#10;    .join(&#39;; &#39;);&#10;}&#10;&#10;const csp = buildCSP({&#10;  &#39;default-src&#39;: [&quot;&#39;self&#39;&quot;],&#10;  &#39;script-src&#39;: [&quot;&#39;self&#39;&quot;, &quot;&#39;nonce-abc123&#39;&quot;],&#10;  &#39;style-src&#39;: [&quot;&#39;self&#39;&quot;, &quot;&#39;unsafe-inline&#39;&quot;],&#10;  &#39;img-src&#39;: [&quot;&#39;self&#39;&quot;, &#39;data:&#39;, &#39;https://cdn.example.com&#39;],&#10;  &#39;connect-src&#39;: [&quot;&#39;self&#39;&quot;, &#39;https://api.example.com&#39;],&#10;  &#39;font-src&#39;: [&quot;&#39;self&#39;&quot;, &#39;https://fonts.gstatic.com&#39;],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CSPDirectives</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'default-src'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'script-src'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'style-src'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'img-src'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'connect-src'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'font-src'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'frame-src'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">